# Both API and Client images build from repo root (npm workspaces need every workspace's
# package.json present — see Vespera.Client/Dockerfile). Vespera.Mobile isn't built here, but its
# package.json still has to reach the context for `npm ci` to resolve the workspace lockfile.
Vespera.Mobile/**
!Vespera.Mobile/package.json

